## Purpose

The owner approved the ten highlighted cutouts, then requested exactly FIVE picked
randomly from them, without further questions. Scatter them non-uniformly, not in
a circle. Preserve the full assortment inside. This supersedes the initial
ten-piece arrangement and the older paused selection task.

