- Exactly five from the ten approved cutouts; no reroll or unselected source pieces.
- Five disconnected silhouettes, including an interior piece rather than a perimeter ring.
- Cover-only change; all inside photos/enlargement destinations remain unchanged.
- No new image-tool viewing, source uploads or implicit archive publication.

